From 5eb5e33bcd0dddf0ca7e4a17207e6ef3e58f8066 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sgrolik-base <s.grolik@baselinker.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:06:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] feat: start screen setting, auto-dial tel: links, 'Paste
 number' hint

- Settings > General > Start screen: last used, Calls dialer, Calls
  history, Messages or Apps
- Settings > General > Dial phone links immediately (on by default):
  a tel: link starts the call; on cold start it waits up to 60 s for
  the Bluetooth line and only dials if the number is unchanged
- Dialer number field placeholder is now 'Paste number'

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
